WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.325
A change in one population passes along the food web, one link at a time.

2
00:00:06.402 --> 00:00:10.977
Foxes eat rabbits, and rabbits eat grass; now remove the foxes.

3
00:00:13.009 --> 00:00:16.359
With no foxes eating them, there are more rabbits.

4
00:00:18.164 --> 00:00:21.564
More rabbits eat more grass, so there is less grass.

5
00:00:26.219 --> 00:00:30.444
The effect passed along the web one link at a time: a cascade.
